1
00:00:00,668 --> 00:00:02,298
(Leonard:)Nice little bot you've got here.

2
00:00:02,461 --> 00:00:04,041
(Kripke:)I'm aware.

3
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:06,260
(Leonard:)What's this do, spin?

4
00:00:06,424 --> 00:00:09,054
(Kripke:)Yep. At 3400 rpm.

5
00:00:09,218 --> 00:00:12,308
(Kripke:)It can cut through steel
like it was rubber.

6
00:00:13,764 --> 00:00:15,264
(Leonard:)Neat.

7
00:00:16,517 --> 00:00:17,597
(Leonard:)Good work.

8
00:00:18,185 --> 00:00:20,025
Sheldon, we've gotta call this off.

9
00:00:20,187 --> 00:00:21,437
(Sheldon:)No, Leonard.

10
00:00:21,605 --> 00:00:26,155
(Sheldon:)For years, merciless thugs like Kripke have
made my life a series of painful noogies...

11
00:00:26,318 --> 00:00:30,818
(Sheldon:)...and humiliating wedgies
and the insensitively named Indian burns.

12
00:00:32,116 --> 00:00:34,746
- Well, that stops now.
- Sheldon, we don't have a chance.

13
00:00:34,910 --> 00:00:37,000
(Raj:)The only improvement
you were able to make...

14
00:00:37,163 --> 00:00:39,413
(Raj:)...was to put fresh batteries
in the remote.

15
00:00:39,874 --> 00:00:43,124
(Sheldon:)What you fail to realize is Kripke suffers
from a fatal flaw:

16
00:00:43,294 --> 00:00:47,674
(Sheldon:)Overconfidence from his robot's
massive size and its overwhelming power.

17
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:50,720
(Raj:)That's not overconfidence.
That's observation.

